# HelpMeLearn - Project Overview

An open-source AI-powered learning companion that ingests technical PDFs and provides chat-based exploration, concept explanations, example generation, quizzing, and structured study paths.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Backend | Python 3.11+, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Alembic |
| Frontend | Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui |
| Agent Orchestration | LangGraph (StateGraph, typed state, conditional edges) |
| LLM Abstraction | LangChain Chat Models (ChatOpenAI, ChatAnthropic, ChatOllama) via factory pattern |
| Vector Store | ChromaDB (embedded, zero-config) |
| Database | SQLite (progress, quiz results, study plans) |
| PDF Processing | PyMuPDF (fitz) for extraction, sentence-transformers for embeddings |

## Directory Structure

```
HelpMeLearn/
├── backend/
│   └── app/
│       ├── main.py              # FastAPI entry point
│       ├── config.py            # pydantic-settings config
│       ├── api/routes/          # REST + SSE endpoints
│       ├── agents/              # LangGraph agent nodes and graph
│       ├── rag/                 # PDF processing, chunking, retrieval
│       ├── db/                  # SQLAlchemy models, database setup
│       └── services/            # LLM wrapper, shared services
├── frontend/
│   └── src/
│       ├── app/                 # Next.js App Router pages
│       ├── components/          # Reusable UI components
│       └── lib/                 # API client, hooks, utils
